<title>AUSTRALIA: TOP 20 AUSTRALIAN DIVIDEND YIELDS - AUGUST 12.</title>
<headline>TOP 20 AUSTRALIAN DIVIDEND YIELDS - AUGUST 12.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on Monday.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>					   Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		     RIC	Yield    Close</p>
<p> 1   Mt Leyshon Gold	15.53    1.61</p>
<p> 2   Davids Limited	 11.36    0.88</p>
<p> 3   Cudgen R.Z.	    10.42    2.40</p>
<p> 4   Natl Consol	    10.00    0.90</p>
<p> 5   Aust Tour		 9.38    0.80</p>
<p> 6   Prop Income Inv	 8.55    1.18</p>
