<p> 9   Gen Prop Tr	     8.24    2.45</p>
<p>10   Schroder Prop	   8.11    2.28</p>
<p>11   Centro Prop	     8.09    2.38</p>
<p>12   Gandel Retail Tr	8.06    0.98</p>
<p>13   Central Norseman	8.00    0.50</p>
